ferrocloud console

The console's look (colours, spacing, type, and the patterns of its
dialogs, forms, tables and pages) follows Cloudscape Design System,
AWS's open-source design system:

  Cloudscape Design System
  Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates. All Rights Reserved.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  https://github.com/cloudscape-design/components
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

No Cloudscape code is included: the console is written in its own
TypeScript and CSS, after Cloudscape's published patterns and tokens.
The console uses ferrocloud's own name, logo and icons, not AWS's.
